    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Benny &amp; Nana's Barrel Adventure</strong> you control two charming furry companions as they reclaim their stolen coconut stash from the Long Beak Clan. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple one-button gameplay, 40 minutes-4 hours playtime. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your reflexes, logic and timing to get to the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content and features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-15 stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Collect-a-Thon elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Single player 2D scrolling adventure style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Full controller support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Benny &amp; Nana's Barrel Adventure</strong> you control two charming furry companions as they reclaim their stolen coconut stash from the Long Beak Clan. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple one-button gameplay, 40 minutes-4 hours playtime. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your reflexes, logic and timing to get to the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content and features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-15 stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Collect-a-Thon elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Single player 2D scrolling adventure style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Full controller support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
